t;font-family: inherit;vertical-align: baseline;\">\n            Coffee of the Year award from the SCAA – 2011\n           </strong>\n</p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"margin-bottom: 1.125em;border-width: 0px;border-style: initial;border-color: initial;font-style: inherit;font-variant: inherit;font-weight: inherit;font-stretch: inherit;font-size: 12px;line-height: 19px;font-family: inherit;vertical-align: baseline;list-style: outside;\">\n<p>\n<strong style=\"border-width: 0px;border-style: initial;border-color: initial;font-style: inherit;font-variant: inherit;font-stretch: inherit;font-size: inherit;line-height: inherit;font-family: inherit;vertical-align: baseline;\">\n            4\n            <span style=\"border-width: 0px;border-style: initial;border-color: initial;font: inherit;vertical-align: baseline;\">\n             th\n            </span>\n            Place 2010 Guatemala Cup of Excellence Award\n           </strong>\n</p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"margin-bottom: 1.125em;border-width: 0px;border-style: initial;border-color: initial;font-style: inherit;font-variant: inherit;font-weight: inherit;font-stretch: inherit;font-size: 12px;line-height: 19px;font-family: inherit;vertical-align: baseline;list-style: outside;\">\n<p>\n<strong style=\"border-width: 0px;border-style: initial;border-color: initial;font-style: inherit;font-variant: inherit;font-stretch: inherit;font-size: inherit;line-height: inherit;font-family: inherit;vertical-align: baseline;\">\n            10\n            <span style=\"border-width: 0px;border-style: initial;border-color: initial;font: inherit;vertical-align: baseline;\">\n             th\n            </span>\n            Place 2009 Guatemala Cup of Excellence Award\n           </strong>\n</p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"margin-bottom: 1.125em;border-width: 0px;border-style: initial;border-color: initial;font-style: inherit;font-variant: inherit;font-weight: inherit;font-stretch: inherit;font-size: 12px;line-height: 19px;font-family: inherit;vertical-align: baseline;list-style: outside;\">\n<p>\n<strong style=\"border-width: 0px;border-style: initial;border-color: initial;font-style: inherit;font-variant: inherit;font-stretch: inherit;font-size: inherit;line-height: inherit;font-family: inherit;vertical-align: baseline;\">\n            3\n            <span style=\"border-width: 0px;border-style: initial;border-color: initial;font: inherit;vertical-align: baseline;\">\n             rd\n            </span>\n            &amp; 4\n            <span style=\"border-width: 0px;border-style: initial;border-color: initial;font: inherit;vertical-align: baseline;\">\n             th\n            </span>\n            place 2008 Guatemala Cup of Excellence Award\n           </strong>\n</p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"margin-bottom: 1.125em;border-width: 0px;border-style: initial;border-color: initial;font-style: inherit;font-variant: inherit;font-weight: inherit;font-stretch: inherit;font-size: 12px;line-height: 19px;font-family: inherit;vertical-align: baseline;list-style: outside;\">\n<p>\n<strong style=\"border-width: 0px;border-style: initial;border-color: initial;font-style: inherit;font-variant: inherit;font-stretch: inherit;font-size: inherit;line-height: inherit;font-family: inherit;vertical-align: baseline;\">\n            1\n            <span style=\"border-width: 0px;border-style: initial;border-color: initial;font: inherit;vertical-align: baseline;\">\n             st\n            </span>\n            Place 2007 Guatemala Cup of Excellence Award\n           </strong>\n</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;font-family: PingFangSC-light;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.3px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: left;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;font-family: PingFangSC-light;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.3px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: left;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<strong>\n          关于El Socorro\n         </strong>\n</p>\n<p style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;font-family: PingFangSC-light;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.3px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n         Diego是家族第四代的咖啡种植者，19世纪时，他的曾祖父曾在危地马拉南部、墨西哥边境地区拥有一些庄园，也在墨西哥恰帕斯州有庄园。但在30年代的经济大萧条中，他失去了所有的财产，所以他得卖掉这些庄园。后来他的祖父离开了咖啡行业，因为他认为咖啡只会带来麻烦，让你失去一切。\n        </p>\n<p style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;font-family: PingFangSC-light;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.3px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n         1973年，Diego的父亲和他的岳父，买下了他们的第一个咖啡庄园，这就是El Socorro。但在当时，El Socorro只是一个光秃秃的山头，除了一片地、一个小房子、一些草甸，还有一些玉米田和蔬菜田，一无所有。\n        </p>\n<p style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;font-family: PingFangSC-light;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.3px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n         Diego出生在1977年，在家里的各个庄园里长大，中学毕业后，他决定学习农业科学，在哥斯达黎加的湿热地区农业学院（EARTH）大学期间，Juan的论文都是关于咖啡的。但是当他毕业的时候，他不想回到家里为父亲工作。毕业两周之后，他还没有找到工作，Juan的父亲说：这个产季，你就来庄园里帮工四个月吧，随后，Juan想着就做这四五个月，之后再决定人生，那是1999年，在那之后，Juan就再也没有放弃咖啡。\n         <strong style=\"color: rgb(62, 62, 62);font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 1px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n</strong>\n</p>\n<p>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-top: 10px;margin-bottom: 10px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;width: 556px;height: auto;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/fqWFXUt6zIBw0CiabAHaYNpj7UeNmlludzWNXv47A0qEw9zJ7vjGhtopAPorpVcA6RlqL7SLF2MfRmjAGX03IMw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" style=\"outline: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;vertical-align: middle;width: 556px;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible !important;\"/>\n</section>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-top: 10px;margin-bottom: 10px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          众号的文章板块有豆子信息\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          淘宝店铺和有赞小程序可选购更多豆子～\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7Q09FO8svc4MbsT6kYe0icjVt0iafAKEvQb4V0sg5ELeaSJuChicNO6jr9zxGVFVu7wDwt3ibVQgXa5ow/640?wx_fmt=png\" style=\"outline: 0px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;width: 388px !important;visibility: visible !important;\"/>\n</section>\n</div>",
